// world-physics affordance as IsFlammable/MartialForce, not a per-item gram count (the pivot has
// no pound bookkeeping). A weapon is hefty, a tool middling, food/cloth light. Summed over what an
// actor carries it drives ENCUMBRANCE (load → graded penalty to physical contests). Only items are
// carriable, so this is read for items; an unclassified thing weighs a notch.
func (c Category) Weight() int {
	switch c {
	case CategoryWeapon:
		return 3
	case CategoryTool, CategoryMisc:
